<title>USA: NY Dormitory $162 mln sale set for week of Sept 30.</title>
<headline>NY Dormitory $162 mln sale set for week of Sept 30.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York State Dormitory Authority expects to sell $162 million of State University education facility revenue bonds during the week of September 30.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Inc is bookrunner for the negotiated offering.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
